      "value": "After more testing, I discovered some more reproduction steps.\n\nJust loading into the avatar normally won't trigger it. You have to select the cube, switch out of the avatar, switch back into it and the cube will be stuck on.\n\nAlso switching the T Pose controller to use WD Off while keeping the rest of the avatar on WD On also fixes it.\n\nSo TLDR; a WD On T Pose controller breaks WD On Animators in the fx layer that trigger mesh toggles. If you leave a toggle on, switch out and back into the avatar, it'll become stuck on.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
