  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If you add a tpose controller to an avatar that uses WD on, it breaks mesh toggles in the beta.\n\nHere's an ID to show the issue: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_5fccf335-584e-4461-a682-eb669d7f37af\n\nOn live, the sphere and cube get toggled seperately: https://streamable.com/nnjive\n\nBut on Beta, the cube gets stuck on whenever the sphere is toggled: https://streamable.com/7uzmlq\n\nThis started occurring on the previous beta (1347) but I couldn't figure out why until now.\n\nHere's also some screenshots of the animators. The FX layer just uses an Int. \n\nFor the T-Pose controller, Im just using the basic gogoloco one. But any T-Pose controller seems to cause it.\n\nIf I remove the T-pose controller, it fixes the issue and the mesh toggles like live.",
